{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33705","headline":"自惠山至吴下寄酬南徐从事 · 李骘","name":"自惠山至吴下寄酬南徐从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不接芳晨游，独此长洲苑。\n风颜一成阻，翰墨劳空返。\n悠悠汀渚长，杳杳苹花晚。\n如何西府欢，尚念东吴远。\n瑶音动清韵，兰思芬盈畹。\n犹及九峰春，归吟白云巘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李骘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}